# marialoni.org

Jekyll 4 + jekyll-scholar academic site. Custom domain `www.marialoni.org` (GitHub Pages). Vite bundles Bootstrap/jQuery assets.

Content lives in `content/` (Markdown + bibliographies); PDFs in `resources/`. No Dev Container. Preview: `npm start` → http://localhost:4000/. Publish is CI on `main`.

Part of the **rednaw portfolio**. Do not web-search it. Skill `rednaw-map`.
